---
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<section id="notes" class="block">
  <h2 class="sheet-title reveal"><span>SHT 09</span> GENERAL NOTES</h2>
  <ol class="gennotes reveal">
    <li>SUBJECT BUILDS DATA PLATFORMS THE WAY HE BUILDS FURNITURE: <b>MEASURE TWICE, BUILD ONCE.</b></li>
    <li>CURRENT CLIENTS ARE LITERAL BUILDERS — CONSTRUCTION GROUPS <b>HEIJMANS</b> AND <b>TBI</b>. SUBJECT SPEAKS FLUENT CONSTRUCTION.</li>
    <li>SUBJECT IS <b>MARRIED</b>. PRIMARY CONNECTION: PERMANENT, LOAD-BEARING, NOT UP FOR VALUE ENGINEERING.</li>
    <li><span class="wip">CHANGE ORDER APPROVED:</span> ONE (1) JUNIOR RESIDENT UNDER CONSTRUCTION. <b>SUBJECT IS BECOMING A FATHER.</b> DELIVERY DATE: SEE STORK.</li>
    <li>OFF-DUTY WORKSHOP OUTPUT: FURNITURE DESIGN, KITCHENS, TINY-HOUSE ARCHITECTURE. ALL LOAD-BEARING JOKES INTENDED.</li>
    <li>RESIDENCE ({profile.location.toUpperCase()}): EVERYTHING THAT CAN BE AUTOMATED, IS. DESK SETUP: PERMANENTLY IN <b>v-NEXT</b>.</li>
    <li>KITCHEN OUTPUT RANGES FROM 14-HOUR LOW &amp; SLOW BBQ TO FINE-DINING TASTING MENUS. SUBJECT ALMOST BECAME A CHEF; THE INDUSTRY'S LOSS.</li>
    <li>LONG-TERM ROADMAP ITEM <span class="wip">[IN BACKLOG]</span>: DESIGN AND BUILD OWN HOUSE. FOUNDATIONS: TBD. AMBITION: POURED.</li>
    <li>ALSO OPERATES: KTM 1190, GUITARS, AND ONE SCOTTISH COLLIE (REX, CHIEF MORALE OFFICER).</li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .gennotes {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    max-width: 76ch;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .gennotes li::marker {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .gennotes b {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .wip {
    color: var(--stamp);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
